node CHOPPED 27.708 29.562 12.118 2.4242 "chopped image\l\l• temp; deleted unless --keep-intermediates\l" rounded,filled ellipse #b38a1b #fff7e0
node SEG_GJ 37.903 29.562 7.6692 2.4242 "detection.geojson\l\l• vein + intervein polygons\l" rounded,filled ellipse #b38a1b #fff7e0
node I1 44.056 24.781 6.2354 2.9954 "Step 1: Parse inputs\l\l• Load vein / intervein polys\l• Snap raw landmarks\l• Compute wing outline (union)\l• Estimate \
image_shape\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I2 52.083 24.781 7.9125 4.36 "Step 2: Build skeleton graph\l\l• Rasterize vein polys → vein_mask\l• Boundary smoothing (optional)\l• Skeletonize (RIDGE / \
medial-axis / …)\l• Prune (distance-map / multi-scale)\l• Collinear edge merge\l• Gap bridging — pass 1 / 2 / 3\l• Compute \
median_vein_width_px\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I3 50.528 18.249 7.6313 2.5683 "Step 3: Anchor landmarks\l\l• Snap each landmark to nearest node\l• Junction vs endpoint preference\l• Store snap_distance\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I4 40.556 18.249 6.7458 2.1412 "Step 4: Compute wing axis\l\l• Proximal / distal from landmarks\l• Unit vector + length\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I5 48.694 13.743 7.1521 5.1308 "Step 5: Call veins\l\l• Merge through crossvein junctions\l• Detect costa (margin band)\l• Propagate labels through deg-2\l• \
Extend to distal landmarks\l• Detect L6\l• Detect crossveins (ACV / PCV)\l• Label ectopic veins (EV*)\l• Assign tissue polys (\
buffer vw)\l• h-maxima split of intervein polys\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I6 40.444 13.743 6.5167 2.9954 "Step 6: Call intervein regions\l\l• Buffer vein centerlines\l• Match bounding-vein sets\l• Tie-break by wing-axis position\l• \
Absorb tiny fragments\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node MM 52.708 21.067 11.152 2.5683 "measurementMaker: custom distances\l\l• User-defined landmark-pair distances\l• Augments batch CSV with custom_<label>_um columns\l• \
Fast path: emits CSV without running identifyFeatures\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node WR 40.444 7.528 14.991 4.2362 "WingResult\l\l• veins: list[VeinIdentification]\l• intervein_regions: list[InterveinRegion]\l• landmarks, wing_outline, warnings\l• \
